<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Backend Engineer Portfolio | Rishabh Dubey</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.1/font/bootstrap-icons.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;600;800&family=Fira+Code:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-dark: #0a0b1e;
            --bg-card: #16183d;
            --accent-primary: #7c4dff; /* Vibrant Purple */
            --accent-secondary: #00e5ff; /* Neon Cyan */
            --text-main: #ffffff;
            --text-muted: #b0b3d6;
        }

        @keyframes fadeInUp {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        @keyframes float {
            0% { transform: translateY(0px); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-10px); }
            100% { transform: translateY(0px); }
        }

        @keyframes gradientMove {
            0% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
            50% { background-position: 100% 50%; }
            100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-dark);
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
            color: var(--text-main);
            overflow-x: hidden;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }

        /* Abstract Glow Blobs */
        .blob {
            position: absolute;
            width: 500px;
            height: 500px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--accent-primary) 0%, transparent 70%);
            filter: blur(80px);
            border-radius: 50%;
            z-index: -1;
            opacity: 0.2;
            top: -200px;
            right: -100px;
            animation: float 10s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        .blob-2 {
            position: absolute;
            width: 400px;
            height: 400px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--accent-secondary) 0%, transparent 70%);
            filter: blur(80px);
            border-radius: 50%;
            z-index: -1;
            opacity: 0.15;
            bottom: -100px;
            left: -100px;
            animation: float 8s ease-in-out infinite reverse;
        }

        .navbar {
            background: rgba(10, 11, 30, 0.7);
            backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            padding: 1rem 0;
        }

        .hero {
            padding: clamp(120px, 15vh, 200px) 0 80px 0;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(124, 77, 255, 0.1) 0%, var(--bg-dark) 100%);
        }

        .hero-content {
            animation: fadeInUp 1s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 5.5rem);
            font-weight: 800;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff 30%, var(--accent-primary) 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            letter-spacing: -2px;
            line-height: 1.1;
        }

        .stack-badge {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            color: var(--accent-secondary);
            padding: 10px 22px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 5px;
            display: inline-flex;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.2);
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .stack-badge:hover {
            background: var(--accent-secondary);
            color: var(--bg-dark);
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.3);
        }

        .crud-card {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            padding: 35px;
            transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.165, 0.84, 0.44, 1);
            height: 100%;
            border-radius: 24px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .crud-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, transparent, rgba(124, 77, 255, 0.1), transparent);
            transform: translateX(-100%);
            transition: 0.6s;
        }

        .crud-card:hover::before {
            transform: translateX(100%);
        }

        .crud-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            border-color: var(--accent-primary);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
        }

        .method-tag {
            font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .get { background: rgba(97, 175, 239, 0.2); color: #61afef; border: 1px solid #61afef; }
        .post { background: rgba(152, 195, 121, 0.2); color: #98c379; border: 1px solid #98c379; }
        .patch { background: rgba(229, 192, 123, 0.2); color: #e5c07b; border: 1px solid #e5c07b; }
        .delete { background: rgba(224, 108, 117, 0.2); color: #e06c75; border: 1px solid #e06c75; }

        code {
            font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            color: var(--accent-secondary);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            display: block;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        .btn-main {
            background: var(--accent-primary);
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 18px 45px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-block;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            border: none;
        }

        .btn-main:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05) translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(124, 77, 255, 0.4);
            color: #fff;
        }

        .skill-item {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            font-weight: 600;
            border-radius: 16px;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .skill-item:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            transform: translateX(10px);
            border-color: var(--accent-primary);
        }

        .skill-item i { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-right: 15px; color: var(--accent-primary); }

        footer {
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            padding: 80px 0;
            background: #070814;
        }

        .social-link {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .social-link:hover { color: var(--accent-primary); transform: translateY(-5px); }

        @media (max-width: 576px) {
            .hero-btns { flex-direction: column; width: 100%; padding: 0 20px; }
            .btn-main { width: 100%; text-align: center; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="blob"></div>
    <div class="blob-2"></div>

    <nav class="navbar fixed-top">
        <div class="container">
            <a class="navbar-brand fw-bold d-flex align-items-center text-white" href="#">
                <i class="bi bi-cpu-fill me-2 text-primary"></i>
               <span>CORE_NODE</span> </a>
            </a>
            <a href="/chats" class="btn btn-outline-light rounded-pill fw-bold px-4">Live Terminal</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <header class="hero text-center container-fluid">
        <div class="container hero-content">
            <div class="mb-4">
                <span class="stack-badge">API Architecture</span>
                <span class="stack-badge">Database Design</span>
                <span class="stack-badge">Node / Express</span>
            </div>
            <h1 class="hero-title">Backend & API <br> Systems Engineer.</h1>
            <p class="text-muted mt-4 mb-5 mx-auto px-3 fw-semibold fs-5" style="max-width: 800px;">
                Specializing in building <b>Stateless RESTful Services</b>, Mongoose-driven data persistence, 
                and high-performance server logic.
            </p>
            <div class="d-flex justify-content-center gap-3 hero-btns">
                <a href="/chats" class="btn-main">Test API Dashboard</a>
                <a href="https://github.com/RishabhDubeyCS" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline-dark fw-bold px-4 py-3 border-3">
                    <i class="bi bi-github me-2"></i>Source Code
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="container py-5">
        <div class="row g-5 align-items-center">
            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <h2 class="fw-800 text-uppercase mb-4">Technical Core</h2>
                <p class="text-muted mb-4">My approach to development focuses on clean architectural patterns and strict REST compliance.</p>
                <div class="row g-3">
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="skill-item"><i class="bi bi-hdd-network"></i> Stateless Architecture</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="skill-item"><i class="bi bi-shield-lock"></i> Middleware Logic</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="skill-item"><i class="bi bi-database-check"></i> Schema Validation</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="skill-item"><i class="bi bi-arrow-repeat"></i> CRUD Life Cycle</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <div class="crud-card d-flex flex-column justify-content-center align-items-center bg-dark text-warning border-0" style="animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite;">
                    <div class="text-center mb-3">
                        <i class="bi bi-layers-half" style="font-size: 3rem;"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="fw-bold text-uppercase">MVC Pattern</h4>
                    <div class="w-100 mt-3 small">
                        <div class="d-flex justify-content-between border-bottom border-secondary py-2">
                            <span class="text-uppercase">Models</span>
                            <span class="text-white">Mongoose / Schema</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="d-flex justify-content-between border-bottom border-secondary py-2">
                            <span class="text-uppercase">Views</span>
                            <span class="text-white">EJS Templates</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="d-flex justify-content-between py-2">
                            <span class="text-uppercase">Controllers</span>
                            <span class="text-white">Express Routes</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="mt-4 small fw-bold text-uppercase text-muted">Project Logic Implementation</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="container py-5">
        <h3 class="fw-bold mb-5 text-center text-uppercase">API Documentation</h3>
        <div class="row g-4">
            <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                <div class="crud-card">
                    <span class="method-tag get">GET</span>
                    <h5 class="fw-bold">Index: List Resources</h5>
                    <p class="text-muted small">Queries MongoDB using <code>.find()</code>. Demonstrates the concept of <b>Stateless Read</b> operations.</p>
                    <code>Route: /chats</code>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                <div class="crud-card">
                    <span class="method-tag post">POST</span>
                    <h5 class="fw-bold">Store: Create Instance</h5>
                    <p class="text-muted small">Handles <code>POST</code> requests via body-parser middleware to persist new chat documents.</p>
                    <code>Route: /chats</code>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                <div class="crud-card">
                    <span class="method-tag patch">PATCH</span>
                    <h5 class="fw-bold">Update: Selective Modification</h5>
                    <p class="text-muted small">Uses <code>method-override</code> and <code>findByIdAndUpdate</code> for partial resource updates.</p>
                    <code>Route: /chats/:id</code>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                <div class="crud-card">
                    <span class="method-tag delete">DELETE</span>
                    <h5 class="fw-bold">Destroy: Resource Deletion</h5>
                    <p class="text-muted small">Implements resource removal targeting unique <code>_id</code> parameters within the database.</p>
                    <code>Route: /chats/:id</code>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="text-center">
        <div class="container">
            <h4 class="fw-800 text-uppercase mb-2">Connect with the Engineer</h4>
            <div class="d-flex justify-content-center gap-4 mb-5 mt-4">
                <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/rishabh-dubey-362500298/" target="_blank" class="social-link" title="LinkedIn">
                    <i class="bi bi-linkedin"></i>
                </a>
                <a href="https://github.com/RishabhDubeyCS" target="_blank" class="social-link" title="GitHub">
                    <i class="bi bi-github"></i>
                </a>
                <a href="mailto:rishabhdubeycse@gmail.com" class="social-link" title="Email">
                    <i class="bi bi-envelope-at-fill"></i>
                </a>
            </div>
            <hr class="border-2 border-dark opacity-100">
            <p class="text-black fw-800 mb-0 mt-4">Rishabh Dubey © 2026</p>
            <p class="text-muted small">Built with Node.js, MongoDB & REST Principles</p>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>